/E (The competition is designed to give teams an opportunity to demonstrate their design and engineering skills through a meaningful engineering project. It also challenges the students to consider other aspects of the automotive manufacturing process including cost-performance compromises in the Cost Report Event, marketing and production strategy in the Business Presentation Event. )
