/T (Few months later, the team bounced back and became Runner Up as well as Endurance winner in Supra SAE India 2018. The team managed to carry this streak with a great performance as a result of which, the team was the NATIONAL CHAMPION in Formula Bharat 2019. In the Formula Bharat championship 2020, the team again tried to defend the title but ended up being on the podium at 3rd position. However, the team continued to dominate on the track and won the Endurance event.)
